cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use CAMDAC, please cite both the software and the paper below."
title: "CAMDAC: Copy-number Aware Methylation Deconvolution and Analysis of Cancers"
abstract: >-
  CAMDAC performs copy-number aware deconvolution of bulk tumour bisulfite
  sequencing data, recovering purified tumour methylation rates and calling
  differentially methylated positions and regions. Supports RRBS and WGBS.
type: software
version: 0.2.0
date-released: 2026-10-15
